*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
You should focus on taking out Fallen Bear before Mr. Mer, because Mr. Mer is excessively tanky in comparison to Fallen Bear. Bring [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Macho Crystal Cat]] to knockback Mr. Mer and make room for [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] to break its Shield. This will only work if you have Macho Crystal Cat's True Form as without its knockback ability, it is useless.

Besides that, it's just spam ranged attackers and once the latter dies, just stall the remaining one until it is defeated as well. You should also consider bringing [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to shield Mr. Mer's waves as it is able to continuously knockback Aku Researcher, thus not allowing it to break Fallen Bear's shield.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Mighty Deth-Troy-R (Uber Rare Cat)|Obliterator Diabolosa]]: While [[Land-Air Assault (Combo)|Land-Air Assault]] is obviously a very effective Combo, Diabolosa can provide value even outside of that here. Its 475 range outranges Fallen Bear by a great margin. Note that Diabolosa is very vulnerable to Mr. Mer's Mini-Waves, especially because of its slow speed.

